  "reading": {
    "zh": "从底向上读：storage 是块设备、文件系统、容器与数据服务；execution 在其上提供执行平面；governance 是能力门禁；vscript 是可执行脚本语言；cli 是用户入口；contracts 是被各方实现的抽象契约；api/compat 是导出面；tests/docs/delivery 是保障与交付。",
    "en": "Read bottom-up: storage holds block devices, filesystems, containers and data services; execution layers the execution plane on top; governance is the capability gate; vscript is the executable script language; cli is the user entry; contracts are the abstractions others implement; api/compat are the exported surface; tests/docs/delivery provide assurance."
